# # Flow Diagram (Mermaid)

## Flow Diagram (Mermaid)

    ```mermaid
    flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B{Choose an option}
    B -->|1| C[Reuse last FRD and push to GitHub]
    B -->|2| D[Generate a new FRD]
    C --> E[End]
    D --> F[Proceed with new FRD generation]
    F --> E
    E --> G[Stop]
    ```


